msgstr "WooCommerce"

#: includes/cleanup/class-general-cleanup.php:1016
msgid "Keeps 5 revisions and product tags; also removes pingbacks and trackbacks, orphan elements, old Action Scheduler logs, expired customer sessions and orphaned variations. Never touches non-expired transients (carts/sessions)."
msgstr "Conserva 5 revisiones y las etiquetas de producto; también elimina pingbacks y trackbacks, elementos huérfanos, registros antiguos de Action Scheduler, sesiones de cliente caducadas y variaciones huérfanas. Nunca toca los transitorios no caducados (carritos/sesiones)."

#: includes/cleanup/class-general-cleanup.php:1019
msgid "Membership"
msgstr "Membresía"

#: includes/cleanup/class-general-cleanup.php:1020
